### Meta Function
Resolves #3

Add meta function extract placeholders from patterns within reminder comments. This function is useful for specifying assignees and other dynamic values.

For example, when running `reminder-lint` with the `comment_regex` option set to `@${assignee} remind:\W?`, the core package will return results like the following:

```go
package main

import (
    "fmt"
)

func main() {
    // @arabian9ts remind: 2024/05/03 test
    fmt.Println("Hello, World!")
}
```
 
```
Reminders {
    expired: [
        Remind {
            datetime: 1714694400,
            message: "// @arabian9ts remind: 2024/05/03 test\n",
            position: Position {
                file: "./testdata/pkg/main.go",
                line: 8,
            },
            meta: {
                "assignee": "arabian9ts",
            },
        },
    ],
    upcoming: [],
}
```

